# Placeholders: preencha localmente; nunca versione chaves reais.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@operatorToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@merchantToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@merchantId = REPLACE_WITH_DEMO_MERCHANT_UUID
@documentId = REPLACE_WITH_DEMO_DOCUMENT_UUID
@paymentId = REPLACE_WITH_DEMO_PAYMENT_UUID

### Saúde (pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar vendedor (somente operador demo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"DEMO-MERCHANT-001","virtual_account_id":"DEMO-ACCOUNT-001"}

### Documento fiscal fictício
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fiscal-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchant_id":"{{merchantId}}","reference":"DEMO-DOC-001","gross_amount_cents":100000,"cbs_amount_cents":8000,"ibs_amount_cents":12000}

### Criar pagamento (mesma chave e mesmo comando reproduzem resposta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-001

{"merchant_id":"{{merchantId}}","fiscal_document_id":"{{documentId}}","amount_cents":100000,"currency":"BRL","scenario":"approved"}

### Autorizar no gateway simulado; sem corpo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/authorize
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-authorize-001

### Liquidar: R$1000 = R$800 líquido + R$80 CBS + R$120 IBS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/settle
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-settle-001

### Consultar estado atual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### Razão
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/ledger?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### Auditoria
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/events?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### Estorno integral; preserva as partidas originais
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-refund-001
